            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kapaaran naatupakini, koloma Musa toma owema loka aitejenunet; ido koany, eburukunyit ebela loka Aaron kanuka ateker naka Lebi, alibunit da, kiturote atur, koraite da araito nukakokok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koyau Musa ibelai kere kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT mama ejaas idwe kere luka Isirael: kosesenata, koyana da ŋolituŋanan ekebela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Any 16:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.31.19+NUM.31.20+NUM.31.21+NUM.31.22+NUM.31.23+NUM.31.24+NUM.31.25+NUM.31.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 31:19-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT Musa atiar, “Kinyaka ebela loka Aaron kinaren kaitejenunet, ainadio araun aanyunet mama ejaas idwe lukepali: tetere itanani airurumakinitekec eoŋ, kinyeis atwakare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswama Musa kwaŋin: kwape kicorakinia EJAKAIT ŋes, kiswama kwaŋin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
